version: 3
metadata:
  name: test_error_codes
  title: Nav2 server error codes via stock plugins, TurtleBot 4 + Nav2, in roqsim (MuJoCo)
  creators:
  - name: Wiest, Samuel
    identifiers: 0009-0002-9215-1238
  - name: Ortega Sainz, Argentina
    identifiers: 0000-0002-3873-4435
  - name: Pasch, Frederik
    identifiers: 0000-0002-2626-1538
  version: 1.0.0
  license: CC-BY-4.0
  keywords: [robotics, navigation, ROS2, mujoco, roqsim, nav2, turtlebot4, error, failure]
  description: |
    Reinterpretation of nav2's error_codes system test
    (nav2_system_tests/src/error_codes, jazzy). Where upstream launches only
    controller_server, planner_server and smoother_server with custom C++ error-code
    plugins, this campaign runs the full nav2 stack (files/nav2_stack.launch.py, the
    same world as the sibling system_failure/test_failure_navigator.vast) and triggers
    STOCK error codes that nav2 emits without any custom plugin: requesting a
    non-existent controller/planner/smoother plugin id, or sending a goal the server
    rejects for a stock reason.

    MEANING OF A CELL: one configuration is one upstream error-code test case
    (error_codes.csv lines 32-37). The trial is a single direct action-call that the
    server ABORTS with the error code in result.error_code, so action_call returns
    FAILURE and every cell carries expect_success: false. The analysis verifies the
    specific error_code from the recorded /<action>/_action/status messages (which
    contain result.error_code). expect_success being inverted is a graded-with correct
    fact, not a broken campaign -- see scenario_nav2_behavior_test.osc's header for the
    same mechanism.

    PORTED CASE -> ERROR CODE:
    - FollowPath (CSV line 32)  -> controller_id that no plugin matches -> INVALID_CONTROLLER (stock)
    - ComputePathToPose success/cancel (lines 33-34) -> planner_id that no plugin matches -> INVALID_PLANNER (stock)
    - ComputePathThroughPoses success/cancel (lines 35-36) -> empty goals -> NO_VIAPOINTS_GIVEN (stock)
    - SmoothPath (line 37)      -> smoother_id that no plugin matches -> INVALID_SMOOTHER (stock)

    NOT PORTED, each because the substrate cannot express it today -- recorded rather
    than faked (see readme.md for the full list and reasons):
    - The two CANCEL cases (lines 34 and 36). action_call (the ONLY way to drive an
      action in this scenario framework, which has no FollowPath/ComputePath* typed
      actions) has no cancel entry point; RosActionCall.shutdown() cancels only at
      scenario teardown.
    - The error codes that need a custom plugin goal or state (UNKNOWN, TF_ERROR,
      PATIENCE_EXCEEDED, FAILED_TO_MAKE_PROGRESS, NO_VALID_CONTROL, CONTROLLER_TIMED_OUT,
      START/GOAL_OCCUPIED, outside-map-bounds, INVALID_PATH, SMOOTHED_PATH_IN_COLLISION,
      FAILED_TO_SMOOTH_PATH). Each is listed in readme.md with why the stock stack
      cannot be made to emit it deterministically in a single scenario trial.
  agents:
  - id: turtlebot4
    configuration_files:
    - files/nav2_stack.launch.py
    - files/nav2_params.yaml
    derived_from: https://github.com/turtlebot/turtlebot4/tree/jazzy
    ros_distro: jazzy
  - id: simulation
    configuration_files:
    - world/nav2.yaml
    derived_from: https://github.com/cps-test-lab/roqsim
    ros_distro: jazzy

configuration:
# --- FollowPath (error_codes.csv line 32) ----------------------------------------
# controller_id "no_such_controller" matches no registered controller plugin; the
# controller server aborts the goal with INVALID_CONTROLLER (controller_server.cpp).
- name: follow-path-invalid-controller
  parameters:
  - params_file: files/nav2_params.yaml
  - map_file: environments/hexagon/maps/hexagon.yaml
  - mesh_file: environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/hexagon.stl
  - start_pose:
      position: {x: -2.0, y: -0.5}
  - nav2_test_id: error_codes/FollowPath/INVALID_CONTROLLER
  - expect_success: false
  - ec_action_name: '/follow_path'
  - ec_action_type: nav2_msgs.action.FollowPath
  - ec_goal_data: '{"path": {"poses": [{"header": {"frame_id": "map"}, "pose": {"position": {"x": -2.0, "y": 0.5, "z": 0.0}, "orientation": {"w": 1.0}}}]}, "controller_id": "no_such_controller", "goal_checker_id": "goal_checker", "progress_checker_id": "progress_checker"}'
  sim:
    overrides:
      components:
        floorplan:
          mesh: /config/environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/hexagon.stl

# --- ComputePathToPose (error_codes.csv line 33) ---------------------------------
# planner_id "no_such_planner" matches no registered planner plugin; the planner
# server aborts the goal with INVALID_PLANNER (planner_server.cpp).
- name: compute-path-to-pose-invalid-planner
  parameters:
  - params_file: files/nav2_params.yaml
  - map_file: environments/hexagon/maps/hexagon.yaml
  - mesh_file: environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/hexagon.stl
  - start_pose:
      position: {x: -2.0, y: -0.5}
  - nav2_test_id: error_codes/ComputePathToPose/INVALID_PLANNER
  - expect_success: false
  - ec_action_name: '/compute_path_to_pose'
  - ec_action_type: nav2_msgs.action.ComputePathToPose
  - ec_goal_data: '{"goal": {"header": {"frame_id": "map"}, "pose": {"position": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.5, "z": 0.0}, "orientation": {"w": 1.0}}}, "planner_id": "no_such_planner", "start": {"header": {"frame_id": "map"}, "pose": {"position": {"x": -2.0, "y": -0.5, "z": 0.0}, "orientation": {"w": 1.0}}}}'
  sim:
    overrides:
      components:
        floorplan:
          mesh: /config/environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/hexagon.stl

# --- ComputePathThroughPoses (error_codes.csv line 35) ---------------------------
# Empty goals: the planner server aborts the goal with NO_VIAPOINTS_GIVEN, a stock
# error reached without any custom plugin (planner_server.cpp).
- name: compute-path-through-poses-no-viapoints
  parameters:
  - params_file: files/nav2_params.yaml
  - map_file: environments/hexagon/maps/hexagon.yaml
  - mesh_file: environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/hexagon.stl
  - start_pose:
      position: {x: -2.0, y: -0.5}
  - nav2_test_id: error_codes/ComputePathThroughPoses/NO_VIAPOINTS_GIVEN
  - expect_success: false
  - ec_action_name: '/compute_path_through_poses'
  - ec_action_type: nav2_msgs.action.ComputePathThroughPoses
  - ec_goal_data: '{"goals": [], "planner_id": "GridBased", "start": {"header": {"frame_id": "map"}, "pose": {"position": {"x": -2.0, "y": -0.5, "z": 0.0}, "orientation": {"w": 1.0}}}}'
  sim:
    overrides:
      components:
        floorplan:
          mesh: /config/environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/hexagon.stl

# --- SmoothPath (error_codes.csv line 37) ----------------------------------------
# smoother_id "no_such_smoother" matches no registered smoother plugin; the smoother
# server aborts the goal with INVALID_SMOOTHER (nav2_smoother.cpp).
- name: smooth-path-invalid-smoother
  parameters:
  - params_file: files/nav2_params.yaml
  - map_file: environments/hexagon/maps/hexagon.yaml
  - mesh_file: environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/hexagon.stl
  - start_pose:
      position: {x: -2.0, y: -0.5}
  - nav2_test_id: error_codes/SmoothPath/INVALID_SMOOTHER
  - expect_success: false
  - ec_action_name: '/smooth_path'
  - ec_action_type: nav2_msgs.action.SmoothPath
  - ec_goal_data: '{"path": {"poses": [{"header": {"frame_id": "map"}, "pose": {"position": {"x": -2.0, "y": -0.5, "z": 0.0}, "orientation": {"w": 1.0}}}, {"header": {"frame_id": "map"}, "pose": {"position": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.5, "z": 0.0}, "orientation": {"w": 1.0}}}]}, "smoother_id": "no_such_smoother"}'
  sim:
    overrides:
      components:
        floorplan:
          mesh: /config/environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/hexagon.stl

execution:
  containers:
    simulation:
      backend: roqsim
      config: world/nav2.yaml
      resources:
        cpu: 1.0
        memory: 6Gi
    sut:
      image: family:robovast
      config_files:
        nav2: files/nav2_params.yaml
      resources:
        cpu: 4
        memory: 6Gi
    scenario:
      image: family:robovast
      resources:
        cpu: 1.75
        memory: 4Gi
  mode: ros2
  runs: 5
  timeout: 240
  scenario_file: error_codes.osc
  run_files:
  - "files/*.py"
  - "files/*.yaml"
  - "files/*.xacro"
  - "files/*.xml"
  - "files/nav2/*.py"
  - "files/nav2/*.yaml"
  - "files/models/*.xacro"
  - "environments/hexagon/maps/*"
  - "environments/hexagon/3d-mesh/*"
  - "environments/hexagon/json-ld/*"
  env:
  - PYTHONUNBUFFERED: "1"
  local:
    gui:
      parameter_overrides:
      - use_rviz: "True"

results_processing:
  postprocessing:
  - rosbags_tf_to_csv:
      frames: all
      require: [base_link, odom, nav2_turtlebot4_base_link_gt]
  - rosbags_action_to_csv:
      action: follow_path
  - rosbags_action_to_csv:
      action: compute_path_to_pose
  - rosbags_action_to_csv:
      action: compute_path_through_poses
  - rosbags_action_to_csv:
      action: smooth_path
  - rosbags_to_csv:
      topics: [/collision]
  - rosbags_nav2bt_to_csv
  - nav2_bt_tree:
      bt_xml: files/navigate_to_pose_w_replanning_and_recovery.xml
  - search/bt_coverage.py:BtCoverage:
      goal_x: 0.0
      goal_y: 0.5
      arrival_radius: 0.6
  - rosbags_costmap_to_csv:
      topics: [/map, /global_costmap/costmap, /local_costmap/costmap]

visualization:
  config:
    panels:
    - parameters: {title: Scenario parameters, height: "30%"}
    - world: {title: World configuration, height: "15%"}
    - map2d:
        title: Map
        map: {param: map_file}
        markers:
        - {kind: pose, param: start_pose, label: start, color: "#60a5fa"}
  results:
    run_view:
      panels:
      - nav2_behavior_tree:
          title: Nav2 Behavior Tree
          position: {anchor: top-left, width: 320, height: "calc(50% - 44px)"}
          minimizable: true
      - scenario_tree:
          title: Scenario
          position: {anchor: bottom-left, width: 320, height: "calc(50% - 44px)"}
          minimizable: true
          source: {table: behaviors}
      - costmap:
          title: Nav2 Costmap
          position: {anchor: top-right, width: 320, height: 550}
          minimizable: true
          layers:
            map: {topic: /map}
            global: {topic: /global_costmap/costmap}
            local: {topic: /local_costmap/costmap}
            poses: {table: poses}
      - log:
          title: Run log
          position: {anchor: bottom-center, width: "calc(100% - 680px)", height: 380}
          minimizable: true
          minimized: true
    explorer:
      notebooks:
      - Analysis:
          run: analysis/analysis_run.ipynb
          config: analysis/analysis_config.ipynb
          campaign: analysis/analysis_campaign.ipynb
      - Resource Usage:
          run: analysis/resource_usage_run.ipynb
          config: analysis/resource_usage_config.ipynb
